# Sphinx API docs

New top-level `@public` classes/functions need an RST directive under `docs/sphinx/sections/` (`.. autoclass::` / `.. autofunction::` / `.. autodecorator::`) with the correct `.. currentmodule::`. Core: `api/dagster/`. Libraries: `integrations/libraries/`.

`@public` methods/properties must have Google-style docstrings. Use `Args:`, never `Attributes:` (Sphinx build fails). Only `@public` members appear in class docs (except `dagster_pipes`).

After changing exports, `@public`, docstrings, or RST:

```bash
dagster-docs check docstrings --changed
dagster-docs check public-symbols --package <pkg>
```
